  "headline": "CBA's cash NIM declined by 3 bps to 205 bps in FY26 (FY25: 208 bps). The decline was primarily driven by a 5 bps headwind from asset pricing and a 3 bps drag from liquids/pooled facilities. These were partially offset by a 5 bps tailwind from capital/replicating portfolios and a 2 bps benefit from portfolio mix. Funding costs, basis risk, and other items had no net impact on the full-year movement.",
